@startuml
title Use Case 5 - Klassediagram (Vis data)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class WebUiServer <<boundary>> {
  + expose_grafana_link() : string
}

class "Browser Client" as BrowserClient <<boundary>>
class "Grafana" as Grafana <<boundary>>
class "SQLite DB" as SQLiteDb <<domain>>

BrowserClient --> WebUiServer : aabner web UI (link til Grafana)
WebUiServer --> Grafana : viderestiller via link
Grafana ..> SQLiteDb : read-only visning

@enduml
